# RFC-0009 B4a: force LF in the working tree on every host. crisol hashes the
# raw bytes of committed fixture files (fnv.chainedContentHash) and derives
# cross-host cache keys from tree content; a Windows CRLF checkout would change
# those bytes and break the SAME-tree-SAME-key portability guarantee (§4).
* text=auto eol=lf
